title: LSASS Dump via WerFault/rdrleakdiag/sqldumper
id: f224d129-d12f-4cf6-a413-d6561a6c2885
status: experimental
description: Detects abuse of built-in diagnostic tools (WerFault, rdrleakdiag, sqldumper, tttracer) to dump the memory of lsass.exe, LOLBin credential-theft methods that avoid well-known dumping utilities.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/001/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith:
      - '\\rdrleakdiag.exe'
      - '\\sqldumper.exe'
      - '\\tttracer.exe'
    CommandLine|contains: 'lsass'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate crash diagnostics
level: critical
tags:
  - attack.credential_access
  - attack.t1003.001
